      "sourceTextSha256": "9ffd859882a303221f77c358d7a987f3c6b3d55239a0be3092e8580e1dd11a99",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Transfer to the airport for your flight to Bariloche. On arrival, transfer to the 4★ Rochester Bariloche hotel. The flight is charged separately.\n\nBariloche stands on the shores of Lake Nahuel Huapi, among the forests and mountains of the Patagonian Andes. The centre has shopping streets, cafés, restaurants and the cathedral, built in 1946. This is your first of two nights in Bariloche.",
