        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "runId": "ada-en-04dd2e696333-20261104",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word paragraph 102 omits Rochester Bariloche, the breakfast and explicit first-of-two-nights statement; its hotel table names a different hotel. The worker must retain hotel identity, so this complete block is translated from frozen RU with its separate-flight condition."
